+| 50–60 | 0.016 | 0.014 | 0.003 | 0.003 |
+Goal-line rush TDs overshoot by 3–7pp (the borrowed tail is generous where the defence
+is most compressed). Not tuned; recorded for v2.
+
+### 3c. Full K1 drive log (1,087 games, N=500, cloud run 2,413 s)
+Drive-result shares, sim vs actual (5A-2 kneel-excluded definition): TD 0.217 vs 0.225
+(was 0.184); FG made 0.130 vs 0.158 (was 0.142); punt 0.372 vs 0.374; downs 0.059 vs
+0.058 (was 0.070); turnovers 0.109 vs 0.118; clock-ended 0.091 vs 0.037 (+ excluded kneel
+drives ≈ 0.068). Drives/game 22.1 (actual 21.9). Offensive points from the drive log:
+20.95/team; with non-offensive 0.83 → ≈ 21.8 pts/team (actual 22.4).
+
+### 3d. K1 table (team-level, 1,087 games, N=500)
+Before = 5A-5 K1 (same games, N=500). Cloud run 2,184 s (2.0 s/game; the Mac does 0.5).
+
